# Smart Contract Library System - Environment Configuration
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the values

# ============================================================
# BLOCKCHAIN CONFIGURATION (Optional - Mock mode by default)
# ============================================================

# Deployed contract addresses on Sepolia testnet
# Leave empty to use mock contracts for local testing
# NEXT_PUBLIC_LIBRARY_ADDRESS=0x...
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CARD_ADDRESS=0x...
# NEXT_PUBLIC_REWARDS_ADDRESS=0x...

# RPC Provider URLs (get from Alchemy, Infura, or QuickNode)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SEPOLIA_RPC_URL=https://eth-sepolia.alchemyapi.io/v2/YOUR_KEY

# ============================================================
# NOTES
# ============================================================
# 1. Mock Mode (Default):
#    - No contract addresses needed
#    - Fully functional local testing
#    - Perfect for development and testing
#
# 2. Real Blockchain (Sepolia Testnet):
#    - Get testnet contracts deployed first
#    - Add contract addresses above
#    - Get Sepolia ETH from faucet: https://sepoliafaucet.com
#    - Connect MetaMask wallet
#
# 3. Deployment:
#    - Use Hardhat to deploy contracts to Sepolia
#    - Copy addresses from deployment output
#    - Paste into this file
#
# 4. Testing:
#    - Default mock mode works immediately
#    - No MetaMask required for mock mode
#    - Connect wallet to switch to real transactions
